{
 "sheet": "enemies",
 "about": "The night's enemies (Noah, the creature overhaul): Skyrim Immersive Creatures, Rogues 'n Raiders, Mihail's Zombies and our own Thriceborn (Mihail's CC Zombies' bodies on his zombie race), each under its own mod's name, its own body, animations and AI. localId is the record's id inside its plugin (load-order byte stripped). Tiers by night (minRound); humans (Rogues 'n Raiders' necromancers and cultists) kept rare. bossEvery: a boss every 5th night (Grahzah, Alduin's Grave-Wing, and the Herald stay). mb_* and knight/lich: the mini-bosses (Director RaiseMiniBoss). priest_*: the cities' Dragon Priests (curse sheet). skeleton: the minion the casters raise; volatile: the night-runner noise draws.",
